    "innovation": "This paper reviews methane hydrate stability, concluding that while anthropogenic warming will trigger methane release, the near-term climate impact will be a chronic, significant but not catastrophic feedback, with the largest releases occurring over millennial timescales rather than as an abrupt disaster.",
